    description:'Assign AI 5 different expert roles for the same question. See how perspective changes output.',
    detailedInstructions:'1) Pick one question you genuinely care about. 2) Ask it 5 times, each with a different expert role: CFO, lawyer, designer, a skeptical customer, a comedian. 3) Compare voice, depth, and what each perspective caught that the others missed. 4) Note the role that surprised you most — that\'s the lens you\'ll reuse in real work.',
