    detailedInstructions:'1) Take a tricky business problem with a real answer at stake. 2) Ask AI for the answer directly — save it. 3) Ask again, requiring step-by-step reasoning before any conclusion. 4) Compare: did the reasoning change the answer, or just the confidence? 5) Spot-check one reasoning step yourself — visible reasoning can still be wrong reasoning.',
