    description:'Give AI the same task with increasingly tight constraints. Find your default constraint set.',
    detailedInstructions:'1) Pick one real task. 2) Run it 4 times: no constraints, with a word limit, with a tone, with a strict format. 3) Rate each output for usability — could you ship it as-is? 4) Notice which constraint moved quality most. 5) Write your default constraint set for this task type and save it for reuse.',
