    description:'Two people, same goal, independent prompts. Compare, score, and steal the winning technique.',
    detailedInstructions:'1) Pair up and agree on one target outcome — a specific email, plan, or analysis. 2) Each writes prompts independently for 15 minutes; no peeking. 3) Swap outputs and score each other\'s against the goal: closer, clearer, more usable? 4) Reveal prompts and study the winner\'s moves. 5) Steal the best technique — that\'s the point of the battle.',
