    detailedInstructions:'1) Pick a transformation you do repeatedly — email → action items, raw note → structured entry. 2) Write 3 worked examples showing input → correct output. 3) Prompt with just the examples, no explanation, and test on 5 new inputs. 4) Check each output against what you\'d have done — count the matches. 5) Where it missed, improve an example rather than adding rules; better examples beat longer instructions.',
    tools:['any'], deliverable:'Your few-shot prompt + 5 test results with a match count.',
