    detailedInstructions:'1) Pick a use case that will run more than once — internal helpdesk triage, tone-checking outbound email. 2) Draft a system prompt with role, constraints, output format, and 2 examples. 3) Test with 10 genuinely diverse user messages, including 2 designed to break it. 4) Log every failure and patch the prompt — one change per failure. 5) Final pass: 10 for 10, or document the known limits honestly.',
