    detailedInstructions:'1) List 10 tasks you do every week that involve words, decisions, or data. 2) For each, write a reusable prompt with a blank slot for the part that changes. 3) Test your top 3 on real examples right now. 4) Save them somewhere you\'ll actually look — pinned doc, notes app, wherever you live. 5) Share your best one in the team channel; collect a colleague\'s best in return.',
