    detailedInstructions:'1) Pick a research question with a structured answer. 2) Request it 4 ways: JSON, markdown table, CSV, bullet list. 3) Check the structures actually work — paste the table somewhere real, run the JSON through a validator. 4) Note where format held and where it drifted. 5) Save the format instruction that proved most reliable; exact phrasing is reusable gold.',
