    detailedInstructions:'1) Pick 3 real calculations you currently do by hand or avoid (a weighted score, a compliance percentage, aging buckets). 2) Describe each in plain English along with your sheet layout. 3) Get the formula plus a plain-English explanation of every part. 4) Test each against 3 rows where you already know the right answer — never trust a formula you haven\'t verified. 5) Install the working versions in your real spreadsheet.',
