    detailedInstructions:'1) Start from your First App (or any AI-built page). 2) Request 3 changes, one at a time: a visual change, a small new feature, and a behavior change. 3) One at a time matters — you\'ll see exactly what each request did. 4) If something breaks, paste the error or describe what you see, and watch it get fixed. That\'s the loop professionals use. 5) Show someone the before and after.',
    tools:['claude','lovable','replit'], deliverable:'The evolved app + your 3 change requests, written down.',
